    id: "kangra",
    name: "Kangra",
    state: "Himachal Pradesh",
    tagline: "Home to One of the World's Oldest Surviving Royal Dynasties",
    description: "Kangra takes pride in being home to the Katoch dynasty, one of the oldest surviving royal dynasties in the world. Spread across the western region of the state, Kangra is by far the largest district in Himachal Pradesh — in the shadow of the majestic Dhauladhar ranges, the valley is also one of the most diverse and picturesque. Recorded history here dates back more than 3,500 years; the prosperous land faced many invasions, but the strategically located Kangra Fort held out, even withstanding a Mughal siege in 1615 AD.",
